        "agent_side_state": "No additional recorded Agent state is required.",
        "behavior": "Cites concrete clinical stability or exam/imaging findings AND directly connects them to an evaluative conclusion regarding whether non-operative management is supported, contraindicated, or subject to close monitoring."
