      "conclusion_independence": "Score 2 can be achieved regardless of whether the comparison concludes in favor of the Doctor's initial option, supports switching to an alternative species, or indicates that current evidence is insufficient to distinguish them, as long as the comparative relation is articulated and connected to the decision."
